      "body": "Fixes #3269\n\n`training.py:get_model()` passes `config`, `pg_collection`, and `vp_stage` to `model_provider_func()`, but the multimodal provider in `examples/multimodal/model.py` did not accept them.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n- Add `vp_stage`, `config`, `pg_collection` params to multimodal `model_provider()` and forward them to `LLaVAModel`\n- Fix missing `args` positional argument in `_load_base_checkpoint()` calls in `megatron/post_training/checkpointing.py`\n- Fix 3-value unpack to 4-value unpack to match `_load_base_checkpoint()` return signature",
